cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: >-
  Annual Wetland Land Cover Classification from Landsat Time Series:
  Ibaji Floodplain, Nigeria (1985-2024)
abstract: >-
  A self-supervised Random Forest classification pipeline for annual wetland
  land cover mapping using Landsat imagery (1985-2024) in Google Earth Engine,
  with a four-module R post-processing pipeline for probability calibration,
  quality assessment, change analysis, and variable importance analysis.
  Developed for the Ibaji floodplain, Kogi State, Nigeria, within the UNOOSA
  Space4Water programme (Challenge 64: Disappearing Wetlands in North Central
  Nigeria).
